# FinalPlaylist.com features and concept
*your final groove and testament*

## Overview
**FinalPlayList** is a website that allows users to create a playlist of music representing the music they wish to stand as their final playlist, the musical equivalent of their last will and testament. Some users may use this as a way to tell a story about their life, a list of their favorite songs over time, a list of their all-time greatest hits, or simply the music they wish to accompany their funeral, memorial or wake proceedings.

The site will be relatively simply in nature. Each user gets one page to display their playlist (a "homepage" which will also show their profile pic, banner / title pic, a brief bio description and some buttons for follow, share and other functions)

